<Base title="Privacy"><article class="prose"><h1>A quiet space to read.</h1><p>This website includes no analytics, advertising trackers, or cookies. There is no contact form or email-subscription service connected.</p><h2>Your reading preference</h2><p>If you select dark mode, the site stores that preference in your browser’s session storage for the current tab. It is not sent to the author and clears when the browser session ends. The site works if this storage is unavailable.</p><h2>Hosting and external links</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical information when it serves a page. Its own privacy information applies to that processing. Links to other websites lead to services with their own practices.</p><p>This page describes the features currently included in the blog and should be reviewed if new services are added.</p></article></Base>
